1
00:00:05,510 --> 00:00:10,080
In ActFX, click New to start a strategy.

2
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:15,140
From Template gives you a working starting point.

3
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:21,150
Name it and pick a template, here RSI Reversal.

4
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:29,890
Create opens it in the Editor. Change it and test it until you're happy.

5
00:00:29,990 --> 00:00:33,450
To share it, right-click it and choose Publish to Marketplace.

6
00:00:33,550 --> 00:00:44,250
Fill in the name traders will see as the author, and a short summary.

7
00:00:44,350 --> 00:00:47,010
Pick a category and the symbols it suits.

8
00:00:47,110 --> 00:00:53,530
Choose a price. Free lets anyone add it and see the code.

9
00:00:53,630 --> 00:01:05,330
Publish puts it in the Marketplace straight away.

10
00:01:05,430 --> 00:01:09,690
My Listings shows everything you've published and whether it's live.

11
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:15,600
After you change the strategy, Publish update sends the new version.

12
00:01:15,700 --> 00:01:22,020
Unpublish takes it down. Copies traders already made stay with them.

